    "medium": "Transparent watercolor, with touches of opaque watercolor, rewetting, blotting and traces of scraping, on thick, rough-textured, ivory wove paper",
    "imageUrl": "/artworks/aic-16779.webp",
    "thumbnailUrl": "/artworks/aic-16779-thumb.webp",
